  {
    "id": "2094990968202358912",
    "text": "Geopolitically, we’re back to tit-for-tat military action like what we saw in July, which ended with Brent surpassing $100/bbl.\n\nThe US playbook is to keep doing these limited strikes to temporarily knock out Iranian capabilities to stop the shuttle trade in the Oman lane. The strikes will continue for a while longer, which means no one will step in to short the oil market.\n\nFor the Iranians, will they tolerate this playbook? Or will they retaliate more than the July strikes?\n\nhttps://t.co/zM5jRVQGjs",
