  {
    "id": "2095137787766792603",
    "text": "Valero Energy Corp's 385,000 barrel-per-day (bpd) Port Arthur, Texas, refinery was hit by a partial power outage on Tuesday night following the passage of Tropical Storm Edouard, people familiar with plant operations said.",
