  {
    "id": "2094966074991149445",
    "text": "It looks like two cargo-empty tankers got hit; and US CENTCOM doesn't usually attack oil-laden tankers. NITC have a dozen empty tankers in Iran, and three were already hit over the summer. Other non-NITC tankers got hit too, but we can't currently say for sure whether these two belong to NITC.",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-02T01:50:09+00:00",
